&amp; Futuna</option><option value="EH">Western Sahara</option><option value="YE">Yemen</option><option value="ZM">Zambia</option><option value="ZW">Zimbabwe</option></select></div></div><div class="row"><div class="field"><label for="preferredLanguage">Preferred language</label><select id="preferredLanguage" name="preferredLanguage"><option value="" selected="">Choose…</option><option value="en">English</option><option value="nl">Nederlands</option><option value="de">Deutsch</option><option value="fr">Français</option><option value="es">Español</option><option value="el">Ελληνικά</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone number with country code</label><input id="phone" type="tel" autoComplete="tel" name="phone" value=""/></div></div><div class="field"><span class="label">Email address</span><div class="readonly"><span>ada.sample@example.test</span><span class="on-file"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg>Verified</span></div></div><div class="field"><span class="label">Address</span><div class="readonly"><span>1 Sample Street, Athens, Attica, 10552, Greece</span><span class="muted">From the previous step</span></div></div><div class="field"><label for="tin">Tax identification number (TIN)</label><input id="tin" name="tin" value=""/></div><div class="field"><label for="tinMissingReason">If you do not have one, tell us why</label><span class="hint">For example: income too low, or your country issues TINs only to companies.</span><input id="tinMissingReason" name="tinMissingReason" value=""/></div></section><section class="stack divider" style="gap:24px"><h2 class="section-title">Tax and public roles</h2><fieldset class="field"><legend style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:12px">Are you a United States resident for tax purposes?</legend><div class="choices"><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="usTaxResident" value="yes"/> Yes</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="usTaxResident" value="no"/> No</label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="field"><legend style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:6px">Are you currently, or have you previously been, a politically exposed person (PEP)?</legend><span class="hint" style="margin-bottom:6px">Someone who holds or held a prominent public function, or a close family member or associate of such a person.</span><div class="choices"><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="pep" value="yes"/> Yes</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="pep" value="no"/> No</label></div></fieldset></section><section class="stack divider" style="gap:20px"><h2 class="section-title">Your finances</h2><div class="field"><label for="deposit_12m">Expected deposits in the next 12 months</label><select id="deposit_12m" name="deposit_12m"><option value="" selected="">Choose…</option><option value="lt_20k">Less than $20,000</option><option value="20k_50k">$20,001 to $50,000</option><option value="50k_250k">$50,001 to $250,000</option><option value="250k_500k">$250,001 to $500,000</option><option value="500k_1m">$500,001 to $1,000,000</option><option value="gt_1m">More than $1,000,000</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="source_of_funds">Main source of funds</label><select id="source_of_funds" name="source_of_funds"><option value="" selected="">Choose…</option><option value="salary">Salary</option><option value="savings">Savings</option><option value="investment">Investment</option><option value="inheritance">Inheritance</option><option value="pension">Pension</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div><label class="choice" style="font-size:14px"><input type="checkbox" name="onlySourceOfWealth"/>This is my only source of wealth</label><div class="field"><label for="employment_status">Employment status</label><select id="employment_status" name="employment_status"><option value="" selected="">Choose…</option><option value="employed">Employed</option><option value="self_employed">Self-Employed</option><option value="unemployed">Unemployed</option><option value="retired">Retired</option><option value="student">Student</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div><div class="row"><div class="field"><label for="occupation_industry">Industry of occupation</label><select id="occupation_industry" name="occupation_industry"><option value="" selected="">Choose…</option><option value="financial_services">Financial Services</option><option value="it">IT</option><option value="education">Education</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="occupationDetail">Industry details (if Other)</label><input id="occupationDetail" name="occupationDetail" value=""/></div></div><div class="field"><label for="annual_income">Total estimated annual income</label><select id="annual_income" name="annual_income"><option value="" selected="">Choose…</option><option value="lt_50k">Less than $50,000</option><option value="50k_100k">$50,001 to $100,000</option><option value="100k_500k">$100,001 to $500,000</option><option value="500k_1m">$500,001 to $1,000,000</option><option value="gt_1m">More than $1,000,000</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="net_worth">Estimated net worth</label><select id="net_worth" name="net_worth"><option value="" selected="">Choose…</option><option value="lt_50k">Less than $50,000</option><option value="50k_100k">$50,001 to $100,000</option><option value="100k_500k">$100,001 to $500,000</option><option value="500k_1m">$500,001 to $1,000,000</option><option value="gt_1m">More than $1,000,000</option></select></div></section><section class="stack divider"><div class="field"><label class="choice top"><input type="checkbox" name="declaration"/><span>I declare that I have carefully read, accept and fully understood the risk disclosure and the terms and conditions. I understand that every investment involves risk.</span></label></div></section><div class="actions"><button class="btn" type="submit">Continue<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></button><a class="link" href="/apply/residence">Back</a><a class="link" title="Your completed steps are saved. Sign in with your email to continue." href="/">Finish later</a></div></form><script>addEventListener("submit",function(a){if(!a.defaultPrevented){var b=a.target,d=a.submitter,c=b.action,e=d;if(d){var f=d.getAttribute("formAction");null!=f&&(c=f,e=null)}"javascript:throw new Error('React form unexpectedly submitted.')"===c&&(a.preventDefault(),a=new FormData(b,e),c=b.ownerDocument||b,(c.$$reactFormReplay=c.$$reactFormReplay||[]).push(b,d,a))}});</script>"`;

